## Scope note

These files contain **metadata only**: titles, publication dates, document
classifications, provenance records, and links (URLs) to documents published by
the central banks themselves. The documents behind those links are **not** part
of this repository and are **not** covered by this license — they remain on
their issuing institutions' servers under those institutions' own terms
(e.g. BIS content is noncommercial-use).

